# One tier, VBR, as every language but English ships (tiersFor in
# pipelines/zones/tools/lib/locales.mjs). scripts/zones/package-audio.sh rewrites these
# lines at packaging time; the values here describe the masters this folder holds.
## X-SpokenZones-Quality: standard
## X-SpokenZones-Bitrate: 64

# Spoken Zones plays a pack only under text in its language, so this pack is heard
# while reading Spanish (AL) and never under English.
## X-SpokenZones-Language: esMX

# Generated by `make zones-lookup LOCALE=esMX`. See addons/SpokenZonesAudio's .toc.
